      "type": "text",
      "title": "Assumptions",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Hourly prices come from the `pricing` variable in `o11y/module` and default to the OpenCost values for clusters without a cloud provider.\nA namespace's allocated cost is the **larger** of what it reserved (requests) and what it used. Idle cost is reserved capacity that went unused."
